    {
      "id": "p0086-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A kind monster saves the main character from Flowey. This character serves as a guide through the dangerous ruins, further explains how Undertale's battle system works, and offers the main character a new home in the Underground.",
        "raw": "A kind monster saves the main character from Flowey. This character serves as\na guide through the dangerous ruins, further explains how Undertale's battle\nsystem works, and offers the main character a new home in the Underground.",
