    {
      "id": "p0086-b004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In English, this character is named \"Torie!\", a play on the word \"tutorial\". Fortunately, because the English word \"tutorial\" is already a part of the Japanese language, there was no need to localize Toriel's name into something else.",
        "raw": "In English, this character is named \"Torie!\", a play on the word \"tutorial\".\nFortunately, because the English word \"tutorial\" is already a part of the Japanese\nlanguage, there was no need to localize Toriel's name into something else.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29186811,
          0.29698571,
          0.89535236,
          0.34487143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.28755649,
          0.29627143,
          0.89968432,
          0.34594286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          10,
          11,
          12
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英语版的 Toriel 是 tutorial（教程）的文字游戏。幸好 tutorial 早已成为日语借词，这个名字便无需另译。",
        "status": "draft",
