    {
      "id": "p0086-b006",
      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although nobody intended it, I like how Toriel's name contains the Japanese word torie (\"virtue; merit; redeeming feature\"). Toriel teaches the player how to be a good person in Undertale, so it's a nice, fitting coincidence.",
