    {
      "id": "p0086-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "While working on this line, the translator noticed that it could also be interpreted as a subtle hint about the three different ways of playing Undertale: a difficult path that leads to a happy ending, a murderous path that leads to a bad ending, and a \"middle of the road\" path that leads to a mediocre ending.",
        "raw": "While working on this line, the translator noticed that it could also be\ninterpreted as a subtle hint about the three different ways of playing Undertale:\na difficult path that leads to a happy ending, a murderous path that leads to a\nbad ending, and a \"middle of the road\" path that leads to a mediocre ending.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
