    {
      "id": "p0086-b012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although Toby didn't comment on this line's potential double-meaning, it so strongly parallels the literal meaning of the hint that both meanings can be inferred from the Japanese line too.",
